1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
On a jobsite, the update arrives in a voice note.
Ground turns it into work the whole team can act on.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
We finished tiling Bathroom 2 and used the last
eight boxes of grey porcelain tile.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
There's a leak in the north wall.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Juan should inspect it tomorrow at nine.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Ground links the voice note and photo to Bathroom 2.
Progress updates, stock reaches zero,
and Juan gets the inspection.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The task and photo are already in Ambiguous,
and the site report updates automatically.
Luis only used Telegram.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Tomorrow's hallway needs twenty boxes.
Ground searches supplier pages with Exa and compares
the material, coverage and published price.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Here is the product page behind this option.
Ground has prepared a request to confirm availability,
delivery and the final quote.

9
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:40,000
I review the material, quantity and recipient,
then approve the request.

10
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:53,000
The request arrives, the follow-up is scheduled,
and the report records what happened.

11
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
One voice note. The site is updated, the work is assigned,
and the next decision is ready. That's Ground.
